  m_text: "[In a field\r\nI am the \nabsence of field.\nThis is always the case.\r\nWherever
    I am\nI am what is missing.\r\nWhen I walk\nI part the air\r\nand always\r\nthe
    air moves in\r\nto fill the spaces\r\nwhere my body's been.\r\nWe all have reasons\r\nfor
    moving.\r\nI move to keep things whole.]"
